.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.*.json
.claude/CLAUDE.local.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/projects/
.claude/session-env/
.claude/agent-memory-local/
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/
worktrees/
.codex/

# Java/Maven (retain Maven wrapper and source files)
target/
*.class
*.war
*.ear
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

